---
description: LLM Dev Rules
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---
-All LLM queries should be contextualized using RAG. Avoid direct calls without document embeddings to prevent hallucinations.
-Cap API token usage per request to prevent excessive costs & prompt injection attacks.
-Flag AI-generated responses that contain numbers, financials, or legal terms for human review. Ensure no false metrics are generated.
-Use confidence scores & retrieval source citations before sending outputs externally.
